                                                "sense_id": "3ce959e8-3cb1-3d80-b85e-20fcf1306f1f",
                                                "text": "Her pregnancy was obvious, but this did not desexualise her in his eyes; she was a very beautiful woman, wearing a large green silk salwar kameez that brought out the fairness of her skin and the darkness of her hair."
                                            }
